    "name":  "Waterproof LED Batten 45W - GLOWLUXE - Interconnectable - 150cm - IP65",
    "reference":  "LTP45W-CW-91278",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover lighting excellence with the 45W LED Waterproof Fixture - GLOWLUXE - 150 cm - IP65. Featuring an elegant design of sturdy polycarbonate, it provides consistent brightness in challenging environments (IP65, IK08). Its powerful 45W LED emits uniform and efficient light. Interconnect up to 6 units to tailor the illumination to your needs. Functionality and style blend in this fixture that will transform any space into a luminous oasis.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eWaterproof LED Batten 45W - GLOWLUXE - Interconnectable - 150cm - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet ready to discover lighting innovation with the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm - IP65! Designed to take lighting to a whole new level, this waterproof strip is not just a source of light but also a masterpiece of functionality, durability, and style.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a product that seamlessly combines elegant design with the resilience of high-quality materials. Manufactured with high-quality PC (polycarbonate), this strip not only looks impressive but is also capable of withstanding the rigors of daily use in a variety of environments. Whether indoors or outdoors, in commercial or industrial spaces, the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm - IP65 showcases durability with its IP65 protection rating and resistance to IK08-level impacts. No matter how challenging the conditions are, this strip is ready to illuminate your path with constant and reliable brightness.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd what about the lighting power? With its powerful integrated 45W LED, the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip - GLOWLUXE not only illuminates the space but transforms it into an oasis of bright, clear light. Whether you\u0027re looking to illuminate a wide area or focus on specific tasks, this strip provides uniform and flicker-free lighting that takes care of your eyes while enhancing energy efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut the surprises don\u0027t stop there. Versatility is a core feature of this strip. With the ability to interconnect up to six units, you can customize and adjust the lighting according to your changing needs. Need to illuminate a larger space? Want to create a specific ambiance? With this interconnection feature, you have full control over how you use lighting in your space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its outstanding functionality, the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm - IP65 also adds a touch of modern style to any environment. Its sleek and aerodynamic design complements a wide range of decorative styles, from contemporary to industrial. Whether installed in a garage, warehouse, hallway, or workspace, this strip doesn\u0027t just illuminate the space but also adds a touch of sophistication.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn summary, the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm - IP65 is much more than a simple light source. It\u0027s a testament to careful engineering, intelligent design, and exceptional durability. Whether you\u0027re looking for a lighting solution for commercial, industrial, or residential use, this strip is ready to exceed your expectations and provide a luminous experience like no other. Get yours today and discover a new standard in high-quality lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe versatility of the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm  - IP65 makes it an ideal choice for a variety of environments. It can be used in:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial Spaces: Garages, warehouses, and factories will benefit from its durability and consistent lighting power.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial Settings: Shops, supermarkets, and malls can highlight products and create appealing atmospheres.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWork Areas: Workshops and manufacturing areas are evenly lit, improving productivity and safety.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHallways and Corridors: Provides reliable guidance in indoor and outdoor corridors.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutdoor Spaces: Its IP65 rating ensures resistance to adverse weather conditions, making it suitable for patios and outdoor areas.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorage Areas: Uniform lighting enhances visibility on shelves and in storage areas.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResidential Garages: Provides bright and lasting lighting in garages and parking lots.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Facilities: Covered courts, gyms, and pools can benefit from its constant brightness.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices and Commercial Spaces: Offers comfortable, high-quality lighting to enhance the work environment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn short, the Integrated LED Waterproof Strip 45W - GLOWLUXE - 150cm - IP65 is versatile and robust, suitable for nearly any place where efficient and reliable lighting is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Pantalla-estanca-para-tubo-LED-IP65-60cm.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
